  For the transitive tournament (c3 = 0):
    B[i,j] = sign(i-j) for i != j

  B^2[i,j] for i != j:
    = sum_{k != i,j} sign(i-k)*sign(k-j)
    = #{k between i,j} * (+1) + #{k outside} * (-1)   ... orientation dependent

  This is related to the score sequence of the transitive tournament.
